{
  "name": "dsh-access-gate",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "门禁 · 目录访问管制：在左上应用级导航排「技能」正下方加一个「门禁」入口（官方 slots 座位 sidebar.panellist，order 6），把受管名单（D:\\.agents\\门禁-名单.txt —— 一行一个受管对象：D 根一级目录【名字】或【任意绝对路径】）与磁盘比对并标出差异，逐个受管对象切换三级授权（禁 / 只读 / 可读写删），状态持久化到 D:\\.agents\\门禁-授权.json 供 agent/工具侧读取；判定按「路径段最长前缀」命中（名字键与路径键互不混淆），名单读不到时一律拒绝（fail-closed）；名单增删只在界面里给出差异并经户主点击后落盘（改前先备份）。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh-bundle",
    "access-gate",
    "isolation",
    "authorization",
    "panellist",
    "access-gate"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "bin": {
    "gate": "./bin/gate.mjs"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "bin",
    "locale",
    "test",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20.11"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node test/run-all.mjs",
    "gate": "node bin/gate.mjs"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  }
}
